<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Medtronic cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Medtronic cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities downgraded Medtronic Inc to hold from buy, a Prudential source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.  </p>
<p>-- Prudential later said it lowered its 1997 earnings estimate to $2.24 a share from $2.28 a share and cut the 1998 estimate to $2.65 a share from $2.70 a share.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
